  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>K</mi><mo>.</mo><mi>E</mi><mo>.</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>e</mi><mi>V</mi></math>,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>K</mi><mi>E</mi><mo>=</mo></math>The kinetic energy of electron<br /><br />The maximum energy of photon<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mi>K</mi><mo>.</mo><mi>E</mi><mo>.</mo></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>e</mi><mi>V</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>h</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow><msub><mi>&#955;</mi><mrow><mi>m</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>n</mi></mrow></msub></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msub><mi>&#955;</mi><mrow><mi>m</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>n</mi></mrow></msub><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>V</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>h</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow><mi>e</mi></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mi>constant</mi></math><br /><br />Taken <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>log</mi></math>&nbsp;in both sides<br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>ln</mi><mfenced><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#955;</mi><mi>min</mi></msub></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mi>ln</mi><mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>ln</mi><mfenced><mi>constant</mi></mfenced></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>ln</mi><mfenced><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#955;</mi><mi>min</mi></msub></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mi>ln</mi><mrow><mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mi>ln</mi><mrow><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mi>a</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>c</mi></math>&nbsp;the&nbsp;straight line of negative slope.</p>",
